orrect** under the given criteria.\n\n✅ **Final Answer: Correct**"}, {'batch_start': 210, 'batch_end': 240, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2965.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2966.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2967.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2968.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2969.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2970.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2971.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2972.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2973.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2974.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2975.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2976.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2977.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2978.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2979.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2980.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2981.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2982.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2983.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2984.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2985.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2986.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2987.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/frames/frame_2988.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/T1yhBv1ytzw/